		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Export multiple en CSV par individu-année]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=12093#p12093"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Ça y est ! Je viens d&#039;écrire ma première fonction PL/pgSQL, avec une émotion non feinte ! <img src="http://forums.postgresql.fr/img/smilies/smile.png" width="15" height="15" alt="smile" /></p><p>Voilà donc ce que ça donne :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION exportIdYear(tablocs varchar) RETURNS VOID AS
$BODY$
DECLARE
  id text;
  year text;
  req text;
BEGIN
  FOR id IN EXECUTE &#039;SELECT DISTINCT id FROM &#039; || quote_ident(tablocs) 
    || &#039; ORDER BY id&#039;
  LOOP
    RAISE LOG &#039;%&#039;,  id;
    FOR year IN EXECUTE &#039;SELECT DISTINCT to_char(date, &#039;&#039;YYYY&#039;&#039;) AS year FROM &#039; 
      || quote_ident(tablocs) || &#039; WHERE id = &#039; || quote_literal(id) 
      || &#039; ORDER BY year&#039;
    LOOP
      RAISE LOG &#039;%&#039;,  year;
      EXECUTE &#039;COPY (SELECT id,date, x,y, FROM &#039;
      || quote_ident(tablocs)
      || &#039; WHERE id = &#039; || quote_literal(id) 
      || &#039; AND to_char(date, &#039;&#039;YYYY&#039;&#039;) = &#039; || quote_literal(year) || &#039;) &#039;
      || &#039;TO &#039;&#039;/home/postgres/&#039; || id || &#039;-&#039; || year || &#039;.csv&#039;&#039; &#039;
      || &#039;WITH CSV HEADER DELIMITER &#039;&#039;,&#039;&#039; &#039;;
    END LOOP;
  END LOOP;
END;
$BODY$
LANGUAGE &#039;plpgsql&#039; VOLATILE;</code></pre></div><p>Que j&#039;appelle sur une table &#039;bla&#039; avec un simple :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>SELECT exportIdYear(&#039;bla&#039;);</code></pre></div><p>Un grand merci en tout cas pour vos réponses qui m&#039;ont mis sur la bonne voie !<br />Maps</p>]]></content>
